Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=32}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.86,0:02:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIt's a...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.06,0:02:11.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Flower?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.28,0:02:14.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No it's...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.32,0:02:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...a person...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.28,0:02:16.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are ya sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.57,0:02:19.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThat old man just\Nkilled a Great King Squid
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.52,0:02:20.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with one shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.12,0:02:21.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThe question is, why...?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.87,0:02:24.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Was he trying to save us?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.08,0:02:24.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or is he just fishing?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou gonna say anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you wanna fight,\Nwe'll fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got cannons back\Nhere, you bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.41,0:03:05.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NYou try it, and someone's\Ngoing to die.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, NAMI squeal]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.63,0:03:11.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...? And who's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.17,0:03:12.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NMe, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.38,0:03:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Scuse me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.63,0:03:14.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.42,0:03:15.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ease up there, bud.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.47,0:03:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The old bastard's mocking us!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a couple things\Nwe need to know...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.18,0:03:24.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where are we? And who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NYou've got some nerve stranger...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.15,0:03:27.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only polite\Nto introduce yourself
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.00,0:03:31.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before asking a question\Nof someone you've just met.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.32,0:03:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. Heh. All right, fair enough.\NI'll go first. My name...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.78,0:03:36.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NIf you must know,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.81,0:03:38.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my name is Crocus,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.44,0:03:41.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'm the lighthouse\Nkeeper of the Twin Capes...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.20,0:03:43.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm 71-and-a-half years old...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.34,0:03:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemini.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him! I swear it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.10,0:03:46.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NCalm down.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.21,0:03:48.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NYou'd like to know\Nwhere we are,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.92,0:03:51.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but your rude behavior\Nleaves me disinclined
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.10,0:03:52.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to accommodate your curiosity,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.88,0:03:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,except that you are trespassing\Non my private resort.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.26,0:03:59.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'd think\Nit's pretty obvious,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.40,0:04:01.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,seeing as how you were eaten.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.97,0:04:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSo you're saying that\Nwe were swallowed by the whale,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.61,0:04:07.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but since when does a whale's\Nstomach have clouds in it?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.30,0:04:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we've been eaten,\Nwhat's gonna happen to us?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.94,0:04:12.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be digested!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.82,0:04:14.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NThe exit is over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.73,0:04:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CREW]\N– We can get out?!\N– We can get out?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.11,0:04:20.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay, even if\NI believed a whale's belly
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.66,0:04:21.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,could have an exit door,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,nothing's there but sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.73,0:04:25.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something's not right here...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.82,0:04:27.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait... Look at the sky...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.60,0:04:30.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those seagulls...\NNothing's moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.58,0:04:31.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're painted on!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.83,0:04:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a giant mural inside\Nthe whale's stomach!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.21,0:04:35.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NCall it a doctor's playful mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.05,0:04:39.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense,\Nyou crazy old fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.43,0:04:41.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NEasy. Don't let him get to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.14,0:04:42.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just shut up...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.44,0:04:44.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that is an exit,\Nthen we need to get to it...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.76,0:04:46.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.81,0:04:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NAw, great! What now?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.65,0:04:54.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's begun.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.11,0:04:56.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's no island!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.11,0:05:01.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of ship!\NIt's made of iron!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.77,0:05:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause we're floating\Non a sea of gastric acid!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.91,0:05:07.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThat means a wooden ship\Nwouldn't fare well
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.19,0:05:08.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if it stayed here too long.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's with\Nthis freaky whale?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Answer me old man!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's very angry.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These aftershocks\Nare a result of him
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.72,0:05:20.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hitting his head\Nagainst the Red Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.27,0:05:32.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That explains it...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.70,0:05:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why he had such deep\Nscars on his forehead.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.27,0:05:37.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to mention all\Nthe strange howling...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.40,0:05:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why's he do it?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt's because he's suffering!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIt's all starting to make sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what's the geezer up to?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.87,0:05:52.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMore than likely he's trying
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.79,0:05:55.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to kill the whale\Nfrom the inside...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.84,0:05:56.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.67,0:05:58.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a despicable\Nway to kill something.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.93,0:06:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, we've solved\Nthe mystery of the whale.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.78,0:06:01.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now how about we find a way out
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.95,0:06:03.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of its belly before\Nit digests us.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWe have no right\Nto judge the old man,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.10,0:06:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,nor do we need\Nto save the whale.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.78,0:06:09.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What we need to\Ndo is focus on how
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to get the hell out of here...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.82,0:06:25.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWe're never gonna get anywhere
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.47,0:06:28.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if the waves keep\Nsurging like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can we escape\Nif we can't even move?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.41,0:06:32.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NOur only choice is\Nto paddle! Take the oars!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.71,0:06:34.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhatever it takes!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to find\NLuffy right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.67,0:06:37.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI know he's outside!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.04,0:06:39.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I caught a glimpse of him\Nflying out of the whale's mouth!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.76,0:06:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThat old guy just jumped in!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.76,0:06:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NIs he insane?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.48,0:06:47.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The acid will eat him alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.16,0:06:59.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.32,0:07:03.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So dizzy! I'm gonna hurl.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.95,0:07:13.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, that's weird...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.20,0:07:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The whale's got\Na river inside it, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NThings are looking up, my dear!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been successful so far.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.85,0:07:31.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully,\NMiss Wednesday...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.08,0:07:34.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Behind these doors\Nlie the beast's stomach,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.69,0:07:37.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that troublesome\Ngeezer as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.27,0:07:39.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He must be eliminated\Nbefore he can interfere again.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember... it's all\Nfor the whale.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.15,0:07:44.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Indeed, Mr. 9...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This whale's\Na precious creature,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.67,0:07:49.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and one that holds the sweet\Npromise of life for our town.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.99,0:07:54.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys! Crocus just resurfaced!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.08,0:07:55.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NLook, forget about the old guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.08,0:07:58.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our focus should be on finding\Na way to open these doors.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.04,0:08:01.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.59,0:08:04.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here's the plan baby.\N"Three... Two... One..."
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.09,0:08:05.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then we kick through the doors.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Mr. 9.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.93,0:08:08.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm ready any time.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.44,0:08:11.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[distant scream growing louder]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NWhat is that voice, Mr. 9?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NI don't know, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.44,0:08:18.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI can't stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.07,0:08:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're back...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.74,0:08:34.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NNot good! We're\Ngonna fall into gastric acid!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.48,0:08:36.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NLuffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NZoro! Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.08,0:08:43.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, um... I could use a hand!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like Luffy's not alone...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.93,0:08:50.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you suppose the\Ntwo weirdoes are with him?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.91,0:08:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhere'd that old geezer\Ndisappear to?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NForget him...\NWe need to save Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.39,0:09:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NYou've got to stop it, Laboon.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.79,0:09:15.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't afford to beat\Nyourself up any more...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.62,0:09:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's only a tiny\Namount of sedative left.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.14,0:09:21.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And until I can make some\Nmore you'll have to make nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.71,0:09:24.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've told you before...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.80,0:09:27.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that wall divides\Nthe world's oceans.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how\Nmany times you hit it...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.86,0:09:30.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't break.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.79,0:09:32.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not even for someone\Nas mighty as you.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.22,0:09:38.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI don't claim to speak whale,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it seems to\Nhave calmed down a bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.35,0:09:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSeems that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.77,0:09:46.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NNow, we saved your lives\Nfor the time being,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.81,0:09:48.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you'd better talk\Nand make it quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.15,0:09:52.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 9, these\Nheathens are pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.11,0:09:54.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's painfully\Nobvious, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.99,0:09:56.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, if we speak to their\Nhumanity and compassion,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.05,0:09:59.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they should understand our\Nplight... Maybe.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.79,0:10:02.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NYou parasites are still here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.96,0:10:05.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I grow weary of this,\Nand for the last time!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As long as I draw breath,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.34,0:10:10.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you will not lay a single,\Nharmful finger on Laboon!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.93,0:10:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's back again.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWho's the old guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.58,0:10:17.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't bully us into\Nabandoning our mission.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.68,0:10:22.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NWe were sent\Nhere to hunt this whale,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.06,0:10:23.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that's exactly\Nwhat we're going to do!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.39,0:10:26.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And this time,\Nwe won't let you interfere!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.27,0:10:29.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're about to give\Nthis whale a new blowhole!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.44,0:10:30.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire, baby!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NRoger!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.25,0:10:45.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He jumped straight\Ninto the line of fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did he just... Was he\Nprotecting the whale?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.34,0:10:52.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NGo ahead... Waste your time!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.19,0:10:56.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, make no mistake...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.02,0:10:59.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That hulking beast will\Nprovide food for our town!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.22,0:11:05.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9, MISS WEDNESDAY laugh]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.03,0:11:06.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.15,0:11:15.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NUm... What was that for?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.65,0:11:16.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just... wanted to hit 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NI thank you for saving my life,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.18,0:11:24.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,though I must ask...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.52,0:11:25.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.58,0:11:27.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI wasn't trying to save you...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.17,0:11:29.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There was just something\Nabout those two I didn't like.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.84,0:11:30.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NOh...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay, I think it's\Ntime we got some answers.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.14,0:11:34.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And how did you\Nend up inside this whale?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NThese two are\Nthugs from a nearby town,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.90,0:11:39.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,looking for whale meat...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If they caught him, Laboon\Ncould feed the townspeople
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.80,0:11:45.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for at least 2 or 3 years, easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.17,0:11:46.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All they're concerned with
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.37,0:11:49.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is filling their\Nfat, greedy bellies!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.05,0:11:49.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laboon?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.81,0:11:51.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the whale's name.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.90,0:11:53.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a unique and\Nmagnificent creature...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.91,0:11:57.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An island whale one of the\Nlargest species in the world
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.24,0:11:59.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that can only be found\Nin the West Blue...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.99,0:12:03.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't allow them to\Nslaughter him for food.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.45,0:12:04.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that\Nhe's stuck here
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.78,0:12:06.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so far away from his domain...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.04,0:12:09.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, there's a reason\Nhe keeps hitting himself
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.27,0:12:12.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on the Red Line and\Nhowling at Reverse Mountain.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.09,0:12:12.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThere is?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes... To put it one way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:19.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1352)}Inside Laboon's body\Nbeats the heart of a human...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.39,0:12:22.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He has most impatiently awaited
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.92,0:12:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and is eternally devoted to\Na certain band of pirates...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NGoing on 50 long years now.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.73,0:12:33.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NListen closely,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.87,0:12:36.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I will reveal to you\NLaboon's tragic story.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NOne fine sunny day,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.56,0:12:54.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,while I was fulfilling my duties\Nas the lighthouse keeper,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.42,0:12:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,some good-natured pirates\Ncame down Reverse Mountain.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.47,0:13:03.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They were followed by a\Nbaby whale, spry and chipper,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.47,0:13:08.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,whom I would soon come to know\Nas the one and only, Laboon.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.52,0:13:13.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NHe is an Island Whale,\None of the largest in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They are a rare species\Nfound only in the West Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.40,0:13:18.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laboon had developed\Na bond with the pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.70,0:13:20.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,traveling with them\Nfor much of their journey.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.40,0:13:22.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But knowing the dangers\Nof the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.95,0:13:27.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the pirates chose to leave\NLaboon behind in the West Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.12,0:13:29.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NBut the stubborn little\Nwhale followed them anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.54,0:13:32.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a general rule, Island\NWhales are social animals,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.95,0:13:35.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and travel together\Nin family groups.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.13,0:13:38.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suspect that Laboon\Nhad somehow come to feel
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.73,0:13:41.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that those pirates\Nwere his family.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.05,0:13:44.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The wear and tear on the\Npirates' ship was quite severe,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.74,0:13:46.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so they stayed here\Nfor several months.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.39,0:13:48.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that time, I, too, was able
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.47,0:13:50.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to forge a close\Nrelationship with them.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.77,0:13:54.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thus, when the day of their\Ndeparture finally arrived.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.36,0:13:57.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CAPTAIN]\NI have a favor to ask\Nof you, my dear friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Could you look after\NLaboon for a few years?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.53,0:14:02.34,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,When my men and I have completed
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.38,0:14:04.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,our voyage around the world,\Nwe'll be back.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CAPTAIN]\NListen to me, Laboon...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.87,0:14:11.46,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We're taking our ship to\Nthe end of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Until we return, I need you\Nto wait for us here with Crocus.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.21,0:14:16.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't come with us...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.13,0:14:18.46,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous, even\Nfor a mighty whale like you.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry three years\Nwill pass by like a flash.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.92,0:14:23.18,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,And don't forget...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.68,0:14:26.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter the distance,\Nour friendship lasts forever.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.89,0:14:32.39,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's time!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.64,0:14:36.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CAPTAIN]\NAll right, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.14,0:14:39.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We're setting sail!\NHoist the anchor!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CREW cheers]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.45,0:14:46.70,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NLaboon!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to wait for us here\Nand mind Crocus, Laboon.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.99,0:14:52.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry we'll be back...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.45,0:14:54.08,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.64,0:15:09.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NThat was fifty long years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.56,0:15:10.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NFifty years?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.81,0:15:12.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, Laboon has been\Nwaiting all this time
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.99,0:15:14.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for his friends to return...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.18,0:15:15.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No wonder he's upset...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.94,0:15:18.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That kind of wait\Nwould drive anyone crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.45,0:15:30.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThis is some canal...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.20,0:15:31.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazing this\Nwhale's still alive,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.52,0:15:33.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with a hole like\Nthis in his body.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.25,0:15:34.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI suppose you're\Nresponsible for this?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.87,0:15:36.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NJust a doctor's playful mind...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.71,0:15:37.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NDoctor?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.58,0:15:38.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.54,0:15:39.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Legally certified...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.84,0:15:43.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I also ran a clinic on\Nthe cape once upon a time.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.09,0:15:45.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before that, I served\Nas a ship's doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.72,0:15:46.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NReally?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.00,0:15:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's great...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.91,0:15:49.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then join us,\Nwe need a doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NDon't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.31,0:15:53.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I no longer have\Nthat kind of energy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Exploring the seas is\Na young man's burden.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat kind of a doctor\Nhollows out
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.92,0:15:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the inside of a whale...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.77,0:16:00.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMaybe it's part of\Nthe treatment.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.94,0:16:02.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The girl is right...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.48,0:16:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With a creature of this size,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.56,0:16:06.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it's virtually impossible to\Ntreat it from the outside.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.37,0:16:09.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I devised a more\Ndrastic solution.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.02,0:16:10.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here's the exit...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.21,0:16:25.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThe sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.31,0:16:40.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NDon't you think\Nfifty years is a bit extreme?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.48,0:16:42.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those pirates sure know how\Nto test someone's patience!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.94,0:16:44.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIdiot! Don't ya get it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.19,0:16:46.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.61,0:16:48.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His friends are dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.96,0:16:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Why are you all\Nbeing so pessimistic?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.06,0:16:54.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know\Nthat they're dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.48,0:16:56.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They could still\Ncome back for him!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.29,0:16:58.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on. Have some\Nsympathy, will ya?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.35,0:17:00.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought it was very touching!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.12,0:17:01.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean a whale still\Nbelieving a promise
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.38,0:17:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,his friends made\Ndespite all these years?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.34,0:17:05.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a true bond!\NRight, pops?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.46,0:17:06.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NIndeed...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.80,0:17:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the lesson here\Nis that reality is cruel.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.05,0:17:12.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laboon's cohorts aren't dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.22,0:17:14.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The truth is, they\Nabandoned their quest.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.68,0:17:17.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I learned that they turned tail\Nand left the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.77,0:17:19.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI don't believe it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.31,0:17:22.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,984)}I mean, why abandon\Nhim like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.48,0:17:25.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou say they ran\Naway from the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.57,0:17:27.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know if they made it\Nthrough the Calm Belt alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.94,0:17:30.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NI can't claim to know\Nexactly what became of them,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I doubt they'll ever\Ncome back here again.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.84,0:17:37.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seasons, weather, currents, wind\Ndirection... on the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.84,0:17:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,these elements seem to\Ndefy the very laws of nature.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.43,0:17:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Common sense is useless,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.30,0:17:46.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the terror of that fact\Ncan be quite overwhelming.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.82,0:17:48.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, if I've got this straight,\Nwhat you're saying is,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.72,0:17:50.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,these pirates were\Na bunch of cowards,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who cared more about\Nsaving their own asses,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.36,0:17:54.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than keeping a\Npromise to a friend?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.85,0:17:58.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would anyone abandon\Nsuch a loyal creature?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just look at him!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's cruelty on a grand scale!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.23,0:18:04.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if you've known all this,\Nwhy haven't you told him?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.40,0:18:07.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laboon can obviously\Ncommunicate with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.69,0:18:10.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He seems to understand\Nhumans quite well for a whale.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.26,0:18:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NI did tell him...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.67,0:18:13.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...down to the last,\Nmiserable detail.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.07,0:18:16.28,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I know this isn't what you want\Nto hear, but it's the truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.28,0:18:19.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Your friends left\Nthe Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.87,0:18:22.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The bond you shared\Nwith each other was real.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.54,0:18:26.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Just as real as the promise they\Nmade to return for you one day.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NBut, still... face the facts...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.68,0:18:36.60,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Those men are\Nnever coming back.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.71,0:18:42.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LABOON roars mournfully]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.87,0:18:59.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Laboon! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.53,0:19:01.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I say this for your own good!\NThey're not coming back!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.34,0:19:13.01,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I understand that\Nyou don't wanna accept it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.76,0:19:17.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But you need to realize\Nthat this is how things are!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.60,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Laboon!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.86,0:19:36.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NThat was the day\Nthat Laboon began
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.97,0:19:40.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to howl at Reverse Mountain...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.70,0:19:44.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Soon after, he started slamming\Nhis body against the Red Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's as if he believes that wall\Nis what keeps his friends away,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.25,0:19:51.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and by breaking it, he can\Nclear the path for their return.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.59,0:19:52.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI admire his dedication...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NNever gave up on 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.05,0:19:56.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He refuses to believe me,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.54,0:19:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because then he'd have\Nto admit that it's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.24,0:20:01.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that terrifies him\Nmore than anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.77,0:20:04.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way for him to\Ngo back to the West Blue...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.94,0:20:08.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what we have is a\Nparadox of tragic proportions.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.64,0:20:12.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laboon is a lost soul dying\Nto live with his friends,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.41,0:20:14.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but won't stop killing\Nhimself to reach them...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.48,0:20:18.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tragedy. Still for all the grief\Nthose pirates put him through
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.49,0:20:21.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they did the same to you by\Nsaddling you with their burden.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.62,0:20:25.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean you've done\Nenough for Laboon.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.76,0:20:26.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What about you...?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.60,0:20:28.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NThe scars on his hide are deep.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.87,0:20:31.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those in his heart\Nare even deeper...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.03,0:20:32.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He needs someone\Nto tend his wounds,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'm all he's got...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.30,0:20:37.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For years, he's battered himself\Nwhile I've patched him up...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.56,0:20:40.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A strange friendship,\Nbut it works.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.51,0:20:44.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Nis that idiot up to?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.14,0:20:45.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya gotta watch\Nhim every second...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.89,0:20:47.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWe've been watching him,\Nlook what happens...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.64,0:20:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.27,0:20:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Flower Arrangement!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think he's aware\Nthat's our mast...?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.49,0:20:58.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now it's on top of a whale.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.49,0:20:59.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why'd he do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.11,0:21:02.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey Luffy, stop\Ntearing up the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.08,0:21:09.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[howls]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.39,0:21:12.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You... ass...! Luffy... stop...!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.47,0:21:23.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The boy...! He's dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.93,0:21:24.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh don't worry...!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.80,0:21:26.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll take way more\Nthan that to kill Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.77,0:21:32.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha...! Gotcha!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.36,0:21:40.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What does he\Nthink he's doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.83,0:21:46.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou wanna let us in on your plan
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.50,0:21:47.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before ya kill yourself?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.83,0:21:53.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt's a draw!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.76,0:22:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm stronger than I look!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.13,0:22:04.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can always tell when\Nsomeone's itching to fight...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.55,0:22:06.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, if you want a battle,\NI'll gladly give you one...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.56,0:22:10.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your shipmates used to\Nspar with you, didn't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.14,0:22:11.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You miss it.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.28,0:22:14.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I can rival\Nanything they threw at ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.27,0:22:15.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell ya what...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.18,0:22:17.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,after me and my friends\Ntravel the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.12,0:22:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll come back\Nhere and find you.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.95,0:22:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then you better be\Nready for a rematch!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.04,0:22:38.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, not bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.21,0:22:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Consider this a\Nsymbol of my promise
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.24,0:22:42.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to come do battle with you...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.09,0:22:43.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's a\Nrush paint job,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.60,0:22:46.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so you'll have to be careful\Nand avoid hitting your head
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.05,0:22:47.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or you'll rub it right off.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.08,0:22:48.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.52,0:22:53.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good whale!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.15,0:22:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhere are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.27,0:22:59.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where are who...?\NOh, you mean those two weirdoes?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.61,0:23:01.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess they escaped.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.11,0:23:03.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Must have happened when\Nwe were distracted by Laboon.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.30,0:23:04.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder who they were...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.32,0:23:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Wednesday...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.85,0:23:10.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.91,0:23:13.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First, put some\Ndistance between us
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.97,0:23:14.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and these morons.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.37,0:23:16.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then we report to the Boss.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.67,0:23:19.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our time for completing this\Nmission has long since run out.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.42,0:23:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NI can hear the others now.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.15,0:23:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're probably\Nalready calling us traitors.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.76,0:23:24.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.51,0:23:25.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But without our weapons,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.34,0:23:27.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we've no choice but to go back\Nto the office and start over.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.84,0:23:31.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NAnd this time no\None will stop us...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.10,0:23:34.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, no! I couldn't have!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.64,0:23:35.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.19,0:23:37.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's... gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.90,0:23:38.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NWhat?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.07,0:23:40.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.27,0:23:42.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm... What's this thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.94,0:23:44.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NHow could you have\Nlost the Log Pose?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.99,0:23:46.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NI don't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.28,0:23:48.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must've dropped it somewhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.50,0:23:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we're not going\Nanywhere without it...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.99,0:23:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(237,1053)}- [MISS WEDNESDAY] How awful!\N- [MR. 9 gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.62,0:23:56.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! No! This can't\Nbe happening...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.00,0:23:56.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NWha...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.29,0:23:59.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NIt's...! Ahhhh...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.50,0:24:02.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NOh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.38,0:24:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NThe Unluckies!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.67,0:24:05.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NWe're out of time!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NMr. 13!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.05,0:24:08.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NMiss Friday!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.22,0:24:09.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.14,0:24:11.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, we can explain!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.80,0:24:13.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll check in with\NBoss immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.89,0:24:15.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.11,0:24:20.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.41,0:24:29.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.94,0:24:31.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I finally have some\Npeace and quiet
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.04,0:24:32.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I can work on a plan\Nfor the Grand Line journey.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.54,0:24:41.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah... Don't think I forgot about\Nyou, Elephant Blue Fin Tuna!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.42,0:24:42.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn... That's my life...!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.88,0:24:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy breaks it then\NI put it back together!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.88,0:24:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, get off your lazy butt\Nand give me a hand!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.18,0:24:51.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This ship isn't gonna\Nfix itself you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.14,0:24:56.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.89,0:24:59.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mind? Keep it down.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.48,0:25:01.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIs there some problem,\Nmy dearest Nami?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.35,0:25:03.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it's food you're worried\Nabout, say no more!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.52,0:25:04.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSomeone say "food"?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.65,0:25:06.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiots!\NThe compass is broken!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.40,0:25:08.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The needle just spins!\NIt won't stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.99,0:25:10.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.66,0:25:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you,\Nbut I'm getting dizzy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.78,0:25:14.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa... This is cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.33,0:25:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is sadly apparent\Nthat none of you
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.22,0:25:19.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,possess the slightest knowledge\Nabout how things work here...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.25,0:25:22.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you all come here to die?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.79,0:25:24.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, great spread!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.13,0:25:25.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.96,0:25:27.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NThere is nothing\Nwrong with your compass.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.42,0:25:30.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line has little\Nregard for the rules of the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.84,0:25:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Common sense is\Nuseless in this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.93,0:25:37.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The needle... Why does it spin?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.14,0:25:38.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NBecause we are surrounded
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.22,0:25:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by a powerful magnetic field.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.78,0:25:43.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The islands here are riddled\Nwith magnetic minerals,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.61,0:25:46.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which cause all\Nsorts of abnormalities.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.38,0:25:49.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also, the winds and\Ncurrents lack constancy
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.15,0:25:50.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in their patterns.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.49,0:25:54.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a navigator, I'm sure you\Ncan appreciate this dilemma.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.14,0:25:54.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So then...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.01,0:25:56.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't have\Na way to tell direction,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.61,0:25:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this whole trip is hopeless...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.83,0:25:58.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.89,0:26:00.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.14,0:26:01.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're screwed...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.00,0:26:03.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're the navigator,\Nso navigate us outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.54,0:26:06.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is delicious!\NYou oughta try some!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.00,0:26:07.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would all of you just\Nshut up for five seconds
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.78,0:26:08.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I can figure this out!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.99,0:26:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This nose of the Elephant\NTuna is my favorite part!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.86,0:26:12.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.93,0:26:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you have any hope of\Nnavigating the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.51,0:26:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you're going to need\Na Log Pose to guide you.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.60,0:26:18.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLog Pose?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.64,0:26:19.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.85,0:26:20.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a specially\Ndesigned compass
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.29,0:26:23.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that can record levels\Nof magnetism.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.85,0:26:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIs it strange looking?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.40,0:26:27.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, yes, it does\Nhave an odd shape.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.98,0:26:29.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSomething like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.40,0:26:30.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.99,0:26:33.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only a fool courting\Ndisaster would attempt
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.57,0:26:35.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to travel the\NGrand Line without one.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.66,0:26:38.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Understood...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.16,0:26:39.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for one second.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.41,0:26:41.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.21,0:26:44.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me you\Nhad one of those Log things?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.54,0:26:48.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI found it on deck,\Njust laying there.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.24,0:26:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those two weirdoes must've\Ndropped it when they escaped.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.63,0:26:51.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did they?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.80,0:26:53.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhy'd you hit me?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.17,0:26:54.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Felt like it...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.13,0:26:55.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOh, okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.34,0:26:59.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh, but there isn't a\Ndial face on this thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.22,0:27:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NYou don't need one.\NIt's a special brand
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.91,0:27:04.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of magnetism that runs\Nthrough the Grand Line islands.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.53,0:27:06.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Complete with its own set of\Nrules that makes it possible
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.20,0:27:08.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to get around.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.76,0:27:11.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By recording the level of\Nmagnetism between two islands,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.99,0:27:14.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you can chart a route\Nfrom one island to the next.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.16,0:27:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The log pose method\Nis really the only choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.13,0:27:20.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since the magnetism here\Npresents huge problems
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.66,0:27:22.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for conventional navigation...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.63,0:27:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As it turns out Reverse Mountain\Nis a great starting point.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.98,0:27:29.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It produces seven\Nlevels of magnetism.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.13,0:27:32.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't matter which one\Nyou choose to start with.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.05,0:27:34.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eventually all of them\Nwill pull against each other
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.32,0:27:35.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and form one route.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.93,0:27:39.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the island at the\Nend of that route...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.97,0:27:41.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...is Raftel.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.31,0:27:44.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The last and most mysterious\Nin the Grand Line...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.10,0:27:44.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Its very existence\Nwas confirmed
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.96,0:27:47.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by the King of the Pirates,\Nthe only known person
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.96,0:27:50.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to have traveled the\NGrand Line in its entirety.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.44,0:27:51.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Raftel...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.00,0:27:52.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.89,0:27:54.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That must be where\Nthe One Piece is hidden...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.91,0:27:56.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NThat's the most\Nprominent theory,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.70,0:28:00.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but no one's been able to\Nset foot on Raftel Island since.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.41,0:28:03.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NWe'll know soon enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.46,0:28:07.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm satisfied!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.70,0:28:09.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys ready to go?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.17,0:28:11.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you that\Nwas for all of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.00,0:28:12.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He... He even ate the bones!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.67,0:28:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Log Pose...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.18,0:28:15.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to take\Nspecial care of this...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.97,0:28:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the key to finding the\Ngreatest treasure of all time!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.18,0:28:19.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You greedy, bottomless pit!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.93,0:28:22.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You ate the meal\NI made for Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.35,0:28:26.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well I hope you left room...\Nfor your dessert!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.37,0:28:42.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOw! Why's everyone hitting me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.42,0:28:44.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou never think of\Nanyone but yourself and...!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.05,0:28:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSanji...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.74,0:28:46.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYes...?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.28,0:28:48.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NBoth of you get out of my sight
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.86,0:28:55.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before I wring your necks!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.43,0:28:56.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOkay, so...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.01,0:28:57.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Correct me if I'm wrong,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.29,0:29:00.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but doesn't the Log Pose work\Nbetter when it's not broken?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.30,0:29:02.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no... Our log pose is ruined!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.80,0:29:04.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NCalm yourselves...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.16,0:29:05.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will give you my own...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.56,0:29:08.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...as a "thank you"\Nfor helping Laboon.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.57,0:29:17.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh good, I'm not dead...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.20,0:29:21.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHello, dear lady.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.78,0:29:23.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Allow me to\Nhelp you to your feet.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.32,0:29:24.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NOh, thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.37,0:29:25.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNice day, don't you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.58,0:29:26.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.00,0:29:28.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need a favor.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.92,0:29:33.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhisky Peak?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.54,0:29:34.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh. That's a funny name.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.75,0:29:35.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSo what is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.84,0:29:38.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NThat's where we live... Um, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.59,0:29:39.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHow were you stranded?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.70,0:29:40.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's your ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.72,0:29:43.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NWell... It was destroyed.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.80,0:29:46.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Asking us for a\Nride is pushing it, Mr. 9;
Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.34,0:29:47.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,especially after you\Ntried to kill the whale?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.31,0:29:49.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with the wardrobe?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.30,0:29:50.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.23,0:29:51.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am a king!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.94,0:29:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.76,0:29:54.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.39,0:29:56.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't say!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.57,0:29:57.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.86,0:30:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to believe us, our only\Nmotive here is getting home.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.26,0:30:02.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd tell you everything\Nif we could, it's just that...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.63,0:30:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,..."mystery" is\Nour company's motto.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.96,0:30:06.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, we have\Nto be mysterious!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.46,0:30:07.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's sort of a rule...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:07.74,0:30:09.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NWe have confidence\Nin your character.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.40,0:30:11.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't you give us\Nthe same courtesy?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.26,0:30:12.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NPlease! We're begging you!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.46,0:30:13.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Show some mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.74,0:30:14.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't do it...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.78,0:30:17.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These two fools are\Ndishonest to the core.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.32,0:30:18.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.82,0:30:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.82,0:30:20.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I should mention that\Nour Log Pose was broken,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.32,0:30:23.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and we don't have another one,\Nso still wanna ride with us?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.26,0:30:24.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What...?! You broke it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.58,0:30:26.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.42,0:30:27.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those aren't cheap, you know?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.58,0:30:28.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're stuck here too?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.64,0:30:29.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How long were you\Ngonna make us beg
Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.98,0:30:31.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before you bothered\Nto tell us?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.89,0:30:33.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... Sorry... I forgot.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.31,0:30:36.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocus gave us\Nhis Log Pose, so...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.32,0:30:39.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NOh! Please have pity on us!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.86,0:30:42.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 9]\NThat lousy bitch!\NShe tricked us!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.78,0:30:44.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's fine...\NYou can ride with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.70,0:30:47.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou said your home\Nis called Whisky Peak?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.16,0:30:48.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go there.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.08,0:30:51.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why?! These two are obviously\Nsome pretty shady characters.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.82,0:30:53.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would we\Ntake them anywhere?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.71,0:30:55.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's fine... Don't\Nsweat the small stuff.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.74,0:30:56.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.75,0:30:58.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Choose your route carefully.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.18,0:30:59.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once you head out from here,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:59.35,0:31:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'll be committed\Nto that course.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:01.71,0:31:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's okay.\NIf we don't like it,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.65,0:31:04.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll try a different\Nroute next time.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.09,0:31:06.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.01,0:31:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay...! It's time we get going!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.22,0:31:11.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNow that me and\NLaboon have an understanding,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:11.54,0:31:13.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can leave with\Na clear conscience!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.68,0:31:16.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just who on earth do\Nyou think you are anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.06,0:31:17.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that...? Me?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.31,0:31:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm the man who'll\Nbe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.95,0:31:26.53,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS WEDNESDAY]\NNot too bright, this one...
Dialogue: 50,0:31:29.41,0:31:30.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NShould be good to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.95,0:31:33.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose has had plenty\Nof time to store the route.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.62,0:31:36.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The needle should be pointing in\Nthe same direction as the map.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:37.54,0:31:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's pointing\Ndirectly to Whisky Peak.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:40.00,0:31:41.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSee ya, pops!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.84,0:31:43.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for the\NLog Pose! Take care!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:43.46,0:31:44.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NHave a safe trip, my boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.90,0:31:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm off, Laboon!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.10,0:31:48.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be ready to fight\Nwhen I get back!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:52.93,0:31:54.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNext stop, Whisky Peak!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.89,0:31:57.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ready gang...?!\NLet's set sail...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:16.35,0:32:17.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:17.22,0:32:19.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy and his\Nexuberant crew could be
Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.99,0:32:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the very pirates\Nwe've been waiting for...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:22.33,0:32:25.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That young captain\Nsure has a way about him.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:25.46,0:32:27.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's uncanny really...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:28.80,0:32:31.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROCUS]\NWouldn't you agree... Roger?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=33}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=34}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
